Find hidden files	find . -type f -print
Extract strings	strings file.bin
Inspect file type	file file.bin
Check metadata	exiftool image.jpg
Inspect binary	xxd file.bin
Search for flag patterns	grep -RohE 'HTH3\{[^}]+\}' .
Inspect archive	unzip -l file.zip
Calculate checksum	shasum -a 256 file
Inspect embedded files	binwalk file.bin
Inspect audio	ffmpeg -i audio.wav